      "box_conservative_projection": "For a gate horizontal/vertical unit axis a, projected center is a dot (p+R*c-g), projected half-span is sum_i abs(a dot R*e_i)*half_size_i. This bounds the whole box projection, not only its gate-plane cross-section.",
